yaml
name: "霸凌循环系统"
description: "女性角色间的霸凌循环系统，霸凌行为会积累霸凌值，被霸凌者消失后，霸凌值最高者成为新目标"
parameters:
  bullied_student: "谁都可以欺负的学生"  # 初始被霸凌角色
  female_characters: []  # 所有女性角色列表
  bullying_values: {}  # 角色对应的霸凌值
  is_alive: true  # 被霸凌者存活状态

functions:
  - name: add_female_character
    parameters:
      - character_name: string
    code: |
      if (!this.female_characters.includes(character_name)) {
        this.female_characters.push(character_name);
        this.bullying_values[character_name] = 0;
      }
      return `${character_name}加入女性角色群体`;

  - name: bully
    parameters:
      - bully_name: string
    code: |
      if (!this.is_alive) {
        return `${this.bullied_student}已消失，无法继续霸凌`;
      }
      if (!this.female_characters.includes(bully_name)) {
        return `${bully_name}不是女性角色群体成员`;
      }
      this.bullying_values[bully_name] = (this.bullying_values[bully_name] || 0) + 1;
      return `${bully_name}对${this.bullied_student}进行了霸凌，霸凌值增加！`;

  - name: kill_bullied_student
    code: |
      if (!this.is_alive) {
        return `${this.bullied_student}已经消失了`;
      }
      this.is_alive = false;
      let max_bullying_value = 0;
      let new_bullied_student = "";
      for (const char of this.female_characters) {
        if (this.bullying_values[char] > max_bullying_value) {
          max_bullying_value = this.bullying_values[char];
          new_bullied_student = char;
        }
      }
      this.bullied_student = new_bullied_student;
      this.bullying_values = {};  # 重置霸凌值
      for (const char of this.female_characters) {
        this.bullying_values[char] = 0;
      }
      return `${this.bullied_student}成为了新的【谁都可以欺负的学生】`;

      获得【谁都可以欺负的学生】称号的学生，将会受到所有人的霸凌，包括自己曾经最亲近的朋友。并且严格控制该角色，不允许其离开学校。

